#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:201
msgid ""
"Show a notification popup with the artist and track name when the current "
"play queue item changes, when VLC is minimized or hidden."
msgstr ""
"Erakutsi jakinarazpen-leiho bat artistaren eta pistaren izenarekin "
"erreprodukzio-ilarako uneko elementua aldatzean, VLC minimizatuta edo "
"ezkutatuta dagoenean."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:205
msgid ""
"Sets the windows opacity between 0.1 and 1 for main interface, play queue "
"and extended panel. This option only works with Windows and X11 with "
"composite extensions."
msgstr ""
"Leihoen opakutasuna ezartzen du 0,1 eta 1 artean interfaze nagusirako, "
"erreprodukzio-ilararako eta panel hedaturako. Aukera honek Windows-en eta "
"konposizio-hedapenak dituen X11-n soilik funtzionatzen du."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:211
msgid ""
"Sets the fullscreen controller opacity between 0.1 and 1 for main interface, "
"play queue and extended panel. This option only works with Windows and X11 "
"with composite extensions."
msgstr ""
"Pantaila osoko kontrolatzailearen opakutasuna ezartzen du 0,1 eta 1 artean "
"interfaze nagusirako, erreprodukzio-ilararako eta panel hedaturako. Aukera "
"honek Windows-en eta konposizio-hedapenak dituen X11-n soilik funtzionatzen "
"du."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:216
msgid "Initial user scale factor for the interface, between 0.3 and 3.0"
msgstr "Interfazearen hasierako eskala-faktorea, 0,3 eta 3,0 artean"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:219
msgid ""
"Show the errors of VLC at the bottom of the window, and ask before removing "
"media from a playlist or from the play queue, or deleting playlists. Off, "
"the errors are only kept in the messages of VLC and these removals are done "
"at once; deleting a file from the disk is always confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Erakutsi VLCren erroreak leihoaren behealdean, eta galdetu multimedia "
"erreprodukzio-zerrenda batetik edo erreprodukzio-ilaratik kendu edo "
"erreprodukzio-zerrendak ezabatu aurretik. Desaktibatuta, erroreak VLCren "
"mezuetan soilik gordetzen dira eta kentze horiek berehala egiten dira; "
"diskotik fitxategi bat ezabatzea beti berresten da."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:229
msgid "set the options for qml debugger"
msgstr "ezarri QML araztailearen aukerak"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:230
msgid ""
"set the options for qml debugger (see http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtquick-"
"debugging.html#starting-applications)"
msgstr ""
"ezarri QML araztailearen aukerak (ikus http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtquick-"
"debugging.html#starting-applications)"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:250
msgid ""
"Show the playback controls in fullscreen when the mouse moves. Off, only the "
"keyboard shows them (the I key). The skins read it for their fullscreen "
"controller too."
msgstr ""
"Erakutsi erreprodukzio-kontrolak pantaila osoan sagua mugitzean. "
"Desaktibatuta, teklatuak soilik erakusten ditu (I tekla). Azalek ere "
"irakurtzen dute beren pantaila osoko kontrolatzailerako."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:266
msgid ""
"Display the cover art of the audio playing in the player (the cone in the "
"compact view). Off, a plain picture takes its place, which also prevents "
"burning the screen."
msgstr ""
"Bistaratu erreproduzitzen ari den audioaren azala erreproduzigailuan "
"(ikuspegi trinkoko konoa). Desaktibatuta, irudi soil bat jartzen da haren "
"lekuan, eta horrek pantaila erretzea ere eragozten du."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:290
msgid ""
"This option allows the interface to be shown and raised automatically when a "
"video/audio playback starts, or never."
msgstr ""
"Aukera honek interfazea automatikoki erakustea eta aurrera ekartzea "
"ahalbidetzen du bideo/audio erreprodukzio bat hastean, edo inoiz ez."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:293
msgid "Enable window titlebar"
msgstr "Gaitu leihoaren titulu-barra"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:294
msgid ""
"This option enables the title bar. Disabling it will remove the titlebar and "
"move window buttons within the interface (Client Side Decoration)"
msgstr ""
"Aukera honek titulu-barra gaitzen du. Desgaitzen bada, titulu-barra kendu "
"eta leihoaren botoiak interfazearen barrura eramango dira (bezeroaren aldeko "
"dekorazioa)"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:298
msgid "Show the menu bar"
msgstr "Erakutsi menu-barra"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:299
msgid "This option displays the classic menu bar"
msgstr "Aukera honek menu-barra klasikoa bistaratzen du"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:301
msgid "Pin video controls"
msgstr "Finkatu bideo-kontrolak"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:302
msgid "Place video controls above and below the video instead of above"
msgstr ""
"Jarri bideo-kontrolak bideoaren gainean eta azpian, gainean soilik jarri "
"beharrean"

