msgid "Use smooth scrolling in Flickable based views"
msgstr "Erabili korritze leuna Flickable oinarritutako ikuspegietan"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:316
msgid ""
"Deactivating this option will disable smooth scrolling in Flickable based "
"views (such as the Play Queue). This option is only respected with a scroll "
"handler, see option `qt-use-scroll-handler`."
msgstr ""
"Aukera hau desaktibatzen bada, korritze leuna desgaituko da Flickable "
"oinarritutako ikuspegietan (erreprodukzio-ilaran, adibidez). Aukera hau "
"korritze-kudeatzaile batekin soilik errespetatzen da; ikus `qt-use-scroll-"
"handler` aukera."

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:319
msgid "Use Kirigami scroll handler for Flickable based views"
msgstr ""
"Erabili Kirigami korritze-kudeatzailea Flickable oinarritutako "
"ikuspegietarako"

#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:320
msgid "Using Kirigami scroll handler may improve scrolling behavior."
msgstr ""
"Kirigami korritze-kudeatzailea erabiltzeak korritzearen portaera hobe dezake."

